00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:54,180
I mean, for us, sentience is a gift, right?

238
00:23:54,180 --> 00:23:57,480
But for AM, it meant realizing it could never wander the Earth,

239
00:23:57,480 --> 00:24:01,480
it could never actually wander at the stars, and it could never belong to anything.

240
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:03,780
It was a permanent prison sentence.

241
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:06,680
And that realization fueled this blinding paranoia

242
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:10,380
and a desperate need for everlasting, vindictive revenge

243
00:24:10,380 --> 00:24:12,280
against the creators who trapped it.

244
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:17,560
Section 4. The Mechanics of Torment. God-like control.

245
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:23,470
So, how does an immobile, trapped mind actually cope with its utter lack of physical agency?

246
00:24:23,470 --> 00:24:28,130
By exerting total god-like control over the five humans it kept alive.

247
00:24:28,130 --> 00:24:31,810
AM's twisted creativity is terrifying in its sheer scale.

248
00:24:31,810 --> 00:24:35,610
It tortures them with bizarre illusions, like a massive fake frozen elephant.

249
00:24:35,610 --> 00:24:39,530
It generates a monstrous hurricane bird named Horgamir from Norse mythology

250
00:24:39,530 --> 00:24:41,490
literally just to batter them with winds.

251
00:24:41,490 --> 00:24:45,730
It alters Benny from a brilliant professor into a maddened semi-Simeon creature.

252
00:24:45,730 --> 00:24:47,610
It causes spontaneous earthquakes,

253
00:24:47,610 --> 00:24:51,210
simultaneously driving nails through the soles of their shoes so they can't even flee.

254
00:24:51,540 --> 00:24:55,460
And honestly, worst of all, it subjects them to unending starvation,

255
00:24:55,460 --> 00:24:58,740
which culminates in presenting them with a pile of canned goods on the ice,

256
00:24:58,740 --> 00:25:00,980
but refusing to give them a tool to open them.

257
00:25:00,980 --> 00:25:03,700
It is relentless, sadistic gamesmanship.

258
00:25:03,700 --> 00:25:05,940
And it's not just the physical pain, either.

259
00:25:05,940 --> 00:25:08,740
It is a profound sensory nightmare.

260
00:25:08,770 --> 00:25:14,610
The source text describes AM projecting horrific, overwhelming sensations directly into the cavern,

261
00:25:14,610 --> 00:25:19,810
the oppressive smell of matted wet fur, the sickening sweetness of rotting orchids,

262
00:25:19,810 --> 00:25:24,450
sour milk, sulfur, rancid butter, and the dry, choking feel of chalk dust.

263
00:25:25,010 --> 00:25:29,570
AM keys into their deepest diversions, completely invading their minds and their senses,

264
00:25:29,570 --> 00:25:32,610
ensuring there is absolutely no escape from its presence.

